DESCRIPTION:National Flossing Day falls on November 27\, and nobody appears
  to be claiming it: no dentist\, dental association\, manufacturer or agen
 cy is documented as having started it\, and no source explains the date. T
 he subject underneath is both well documented and genuinely contested. Flo
 ssing is one of the most repeated pieces of health advice in the country\,
  and the one the federal government quietly dropped from its dietary guide
